 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Layers are created implicitly by the first setProperty. Every setProperty is a change (even to the same value). undo reverts the most recent applied change (restoring the prior value or absence) and returns false if there is nothing to undo. Includes redo. removeProperty deletes a present key as an undoable change (true) or returns false and records nothing; getProperties returns the layer's [key, value] pairs sorted by key (empty if none).",
